silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_12_orientation_closure_album_sections_03_cheese_clause_reading_concrete_anchor_2#orientationfreemonad silm:hasLongDescription "The OrientationFreeMonad is the free monad on the orientation typed source signature; the encyclopedia. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Free(Sigma)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
